\subsection{Limitations}

% PENDING MEASUREMENT. Only quantities that follow from physical constants
% appear below; each was read from src/Communications.py. The density-resolved
% channel busy ratio and packet-loss figures are to be filled in from the results
% CSV after the re-executed runs. The earlier density sweep recorded in
